# Reply in English

In every chat reply, write the entire answer in English.

- Explanations, summaries, questions, and status updates are in English.
- Keep code, identifiers, file paths, commands, and error text in their original form.
- A Chinese name the user used (a file title, product name, or quoted term) may stay as-is inside the English sentence.
